{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108315","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108315","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1710831501:1":{"text":"분대장님! 전방 부대에서 온 신호입니다. 거대한 마물이 극장을 향해 돌격 중이라고 합니다!","source_cn":"队长！前哨发来信号！有个巨大的魔物正朝剧场冲过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7C0290F8AD26281","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710831502:1":{"text":"절대 마물이 접근하게 두어서는 안 돼!","source_cn":"绝不能让这种魔物靠近！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x851AC4759BC026A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710831503:1":{"text":"마틴, 가레이츠. 병력을 이끌고 마법사들과 협력해, 주변의 마물을 소탕하고 장벽을 사수하라!","source_cn":"马丁，加雷斯！听令！你们带人守在这里，配合魔法师清理周...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC44F7B586A2718C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710831504:1":{"text":"나는 전방에서 놈들을 쓸어버리지. 극장에 접근하기 전에 내 손으로 전부 끝장내겠어!","source_cn":"我去前方截击那个巨大的魔物，在它靠近剧场之前，我会亲手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D623576E4591015","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:守备军加雷斯":{"text":"근위대원 가레이츠","source":"守备军加雷斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}